# The RTC is deliberately jumped while the PIT-backed session keeps its progress.
at 0.2s caption top 3s RTC WALL TIME CAN JUMP - PIT SESSION TIME CANNOT
at 2 key D down
at 3 key D up
at 5 key SPACE down
at 6 key SPACE up

at 1s rtc 2026-07-30T09:41:10
at 1.2s caption bottom 2s WALL CLOCK JUMPS FORWARD

# Pause and resume through the visible mouse button.
at 1.5s move -60 -180 during 0.2s
at 1.8s mouse 0 0 1
at 1.9s mouse 0 0 0
at 2.3s mouse 0 0 1
at 2.4s mouse 0 0 0

at 3s rtc 2026-07-30T08:05:00
at 3.2s caption bottom 2s WALL CLOCK JUMPS BACK - COUNTDOWN STAYS MONOTONIC

# Five active seconds complete the demo focus interval and produce a chime.
at 7.2s key ESC down
at 7.3s key ESC up
